#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A free IBM course on utility-scale quantum computing featuring realistic use"
" cases and best practices"
msgstr ""
"Un curso gratuito de IBM sobre computación cuántica a escala de utilidad con"
" casos de uso realistas y mejores prácticas"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Descripción general {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-"
"practice/hero.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-"
"practice/hero.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course focuses on today's quantum computers and how to use them to "
"their full potential. It covers realistic potential use cases for quantum "
"computing as well as best practices for running and experimenting with "
"quantum processors having 100 or more qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Este curso se centra en los computadores cuánticos de hoy y en cómo puedes "
"aprovecharlos al máximo. Cubre casos de uso potenciales realistas de la "
"computación cuántica, así como mejores prácticas para operar y experimentar "
"con procesadores cuánticos de 100 o más qubits.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Conocimientos previos recomendados {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To make the most out of this course, we recommend a familiarity with quantum"
" information and quantum circuits, at the level explained in the [Basics of "
"quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) "
"course.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para aprovechar al máximo este curso, te recomendamos estar familiarizado "
"con la información cuántica y los circuitos cuánticos al nivel que se enseña"
" en el curso [Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-"
"quantum-information).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Other recommended references include the following:\n"
msgstr "Otras fuentes recomendadas son las siguientes:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Chris Bernhardt. [Quantum Computing for "
"Everyone.](https://mitpress.mit.edu/9780262539531/quantum-computing-for-"
"everyone/)\n"
msgstr ""
"Chris Bernhardt. [Quantum Computing for "
"Everyone.](https://mitpress.mit.edu/9780262539531/quantum-computing-for-"
"everyone/)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thomas Wong. [Introduction to Classical and Quantum "
"Computing.](https://www.thomaswong.net/introduction-to-classical-and-"
"quantum-computing-1e4p.pdf)\n"
msgstr ""
"Thomas Wong. [Introduction to Classical and Quantum "
